          "title": "2019.1.2｜190102|气息",
          "html": "<p>发布时间：2019-01-02 12:11:52</p><p><b>今天发生了什么：</b>今天围绕「190102|气息」继续做语音练习和观察。记录里首先提到：it is all about how to use breath , how half breath says how many words , and how pauses in a whole breath</p><p><b>今天学到了什么：</b>从今天的记录里，我重点注意到：it is all about how to use breath , how half breath says how many words , and how pauses in a whole breath</p><p><b>主要 Learnings：</b>1）it is all about how to use breath , how half breath says how many words , and how pauses in a whole breath</p><p><b>原始记录（保留）：</b>it is all about how to use breath ,    how  half breath says how many words , and  how pauses in a whole breath</p><figure><img src=\"/diary-media/diary-img-836b780eb4daaf2a.webp\" width=\"690\" height=\"374\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"日记原文配图\"/></figure><p>来源：<a href=\"https://blog.sina.com.cn/s/blog_bf3dd80d0102yrf3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">新浪博客原文</a></p>",
